# Monitoring

Set this in the open session. Options → Preferences → Audio → Device. Do not restart Reaper to change it.

- Audio system: WASAPI. Mode: Shared. Sample rate: 48000. Block size: 512.
- Headphones: `Headphones (2- Razer Kraken V4 Pro BT)`. Current choice.
- Do not select a device whose name starts with Headset. That is the call mode.
- Laptop speakers, if asked: `Speakers (Realtek(R) Audio)`.
- An empty ASIO driver means silence. Switch that session to WASAPI.

Bluetooth on the Kraken feels late. That delay is the headset. The USB Game output is tighter and is a different device; use it only when it is connected.
